### ============================================
### WALLET API TESTING
### ============================================

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7000/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Get Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/Wallet/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/Wallet/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Deposit Money (Nạp tiền)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Wallet/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50000,
  "description": "Test nạp tiền vào ví"
}

### 4. Withdraw Money (Rút tiền)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Wallet/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 20000,
  "description": "Test rút tiền từ ví"
}

### ============================================
### TEST WITHOUT TOKEN (Should return 401)
### ============================================

### 5. Deposit without token (Should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Wallet/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50000,
  "description": "Test without token"
}
